<title>THAILAND: Singer Thailand Q2 net profit lower.</title>
<headline>Singer Thailand Q2 net profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited and consolidated financial results for second quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.49    vs	     10.51</p>
<p>    Net			121.22     vs	   141.83</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		8.94	vs	    20.66</p>
<p>    Net		     241.51	vs	   278.97</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Singer Thailand Plc. It is a producer of electrical appliances.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
